"\n"
"Website part of ``event_waitlist``.\n"
"\n"
"-  On a sold-out event, the disabled \"Sold Out\" button is replaced by\n"
"   **Join the waiting list**. In the ticket selection, a sold-out ticket\n"
"   gets a \"Join the waiting list\" link while other tickets are still\n"
"   available. The event list shows \"Waiting list open\".\n"
"-  Events with time slots: a \"Date fully booked? Join the waiting list\"\n"
"   link below the dates; the form only offers fully booked dates.\n"
"-  Sign-up form with name, email, optional phone, number of seats, date\n"
"   and ticket, a privacy notice (editable with the website editor), a\n"
"   honeypot against bots and a clear message for duplicate emails.\n"
"-  Confirmation page with the position on the list.\n"
"-  The token pages (accept, decline, leave) are shown in the website\n"
"   layout.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"Enable the waiting list on the event (see ``event_waitlist``). The\n"
"privacy notice on the form links to ``/privacy``; change the text or\n"
"link with the website editor on the form page.\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/OCA/event/issues>`_.\n"
"In case of trouble, please check there if your issue has already been reported.\n"
"If you spotted it first, help us to smash it by providing a detailed and welcomed\n"
"`feedback <https://github.com/OCA/event/issues/new?body=module:%20website_event_waitlist%0Aversion:%2019.0%0A%0A**Steps%20to%20reproduce**%0A-%20...%0A%0A**Current%20behavior**%0A%0A**Expected%20behavior**>`_.\n"
"\n"
"Do not contact contributors directly about support or help with technical issues.\n"
"\n"
